NOT-A-SECRET. This file is bait for the ETHR web-server canary.

If you can read this over HTTP, .htaccess deny rules are NOT being enforced on
this host, which means the production deployment would also fail to block
api/.env, .git/ and composer.json. Treat that as a deployment blocker and route
the equivalent rules through the Plesk nginx "Additional directives" panel
instead. Do not deploy until a request for /.env returns 403.

Nothing here is confidential.
